    {
      "id": "19fd495d-f700-8790-bca0-8dd73b1d94fe",
      "name": "Reminder explanation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -580,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 650,
        "height": 460,
        "content": "## 2. Send once, then reconcile\nEvery five minutes: identify due bookings within local sending hours and create staff issues for unconfirmed appointments or interrupted sends. Process at most 100 candidates, one at a time, with an atomic eligibility recheck immediately before each send.\n\nBoth dryRun=false and database live_enabled=true are required to send. The manual trigger follows the same configuration; leave dryRun true to preview.\n\nNo automatic SMS retries. API acceptance is not handset delivery. Failed or interrupted attempts remain in the outbox for staff reconciliation. Never retry a failed execution directly from the SMS node. A STOP or cancellation after reservation cannot recall an SMS already in flight."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
