    {
      "id": "61e624ef-3144-ab38-8ec9-a2d70f90e91d",
      "name": "Staff operations",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1280,
        900
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1050,
        "height": 440,
        "content": "## Staff queue and operating limits\nUse the open_staff_queue view in the voxisms_appts schema. The [setup guide](https://voxisms.com/integrations/n8n/appointment-reminders) includes a query that joins unmatched replies to their sender and message. Assign someone to monitor it, or connect your preferred internal alerting channel before launch.\n\nResolve cancellation/rescheduling in your booking system and send an authenticated update back here. Uncertain SMS sends stay visible even after a booking changes. Do not delete outbox rows to force resends.\n\nSet retention for phone numbers, message content and n8n execution data. Review multipart SMS costs for your business name/timezone. One business line per workflow instance. PostgreSQL role grants and a controlled two-way test are required before production.\n\nSetup, queue queries and recovery: https://voxisms.com/integrations/n8n/appointment-reminders"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
